ext":"탐지","x":1624,"y":637,"width":62,"height":41}]},{"text":"된다. 이러한 오류는 일반적으로 운영체제가 처리한다. 사용자 프로그램이 불법적인 명","words":[{"text":"된다.","x":330,"y":704,"width":75,"height":40},{"text":"이러한","x":425,"y":704,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"오류는","x":541,"y":706,"width":101,"height":37},{"text":"일반적으로","x":659,"y":704,"width":167,"height":40},{"text":"운영체제가","x":840,"y":704,"width":170,"height":40},{"text":"처리한다.","x":1027,"y":704,"width":140,"height":40},{"text":"사용자","x":1186,"y":704,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"프로그램이","x":1306,"y":704,"width":174,"height":40},{"text":"불법적인","x":1500,"y":703,"width":141,"height":39},{"text":"명","x":1659,"y":705,"width":27,"height":39}]},{"text":"령을 수행하려 하거나 사\u0026자 주소 공간이 아닌 메모리에 접근을 시도하는 등과 같은 오","words":[{"text":"령을","x":331,"y":770,"width":68,"height":39},{"text":"수행하려","x":411,"y":769,"width":133,"height":40},{"text":"하거나","x":561,"y":769,"width":101,"height":40},{"text":"사\u0026자","x":674,"y":769,"width":102,"height":41},{"text":"주소","x":787,"y":772,"width":68,"height":37},{"text":"공간이","x":868,"y":770,"width":97,"height":40},{"text":"아닌","x":983,"y":770,"width":65,"height":40},{"text":"메모리에","x":1064,"y":770,"width":133,"height":40},{"text":"접근을","x":1215,"y":769,"width":104,"height":39},{"text":"시도하는","x":1333,"y":770,"width":143,"height":39},{"text":"등과","x":1488,"y":770,"width":74,"height":39},{"text":"같은","x":1576,"y":769,"width":69,"height":38},{"text":"오","x":1657,"y":773,"width":33,"height":30}]},{"text":"류가 발생하면, 하드웨어는 운영체제로 트랩을 발생시킨다. 트랩은 인터럽트처럼 인터럽","words":[{"text":"류가","x":329,"y":835,"width":70,"height":39},{"text":"발생하면,","x":411,"y":835,"width":143,"height":40},{"text":"하드웨어는","x":569,"y":835,"width":169,"height":40},{"text":"운영체제로","x":749,"y":836,"width":169,"height":39},{"text":"트랩을","x":931,"y":836,"width":102,"height":39},{"text":"발생시킨다.","x":1046,"y":836,"width":178,"height":40},{"text":"트랩은","x":1240,"y":836,"width":107,"height":38},{"text":"인터럽트처럼","x":1361,"y":836,"width":209,"height":40},{"text":"인터